The 153 .wgsl files in this directory are WebGPU shaders emitted at run time
by the npm package @litert-lm/core, version 0.17.1, published by Google LLC
(https://www.npmjs.com/package/@litert-lm/core, repository
https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM). They were recorded through the
WebGPU API (createShaderModule) during the capture run described in the README while the package loaded the
model bundle gemma-4-E2B-it-web.litertlm in Chrome on an Apple M2 Max, by the
harness in this repository (capture.mjs, www/capture.html). The files are the
captured text, unmodified. The numbering is creation order; the package
assigns no labels.

